WEBVTT

00:00:06.315 --> 00:00:14.315
www.YYeTs.net

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:21.315
www.unioncast.tv

00:00:29.345 --> 00:00:32.015
i know about sam's visions. 
i know everything.

00:00:35.575 --> 00:00:37.845
gordon should be reaching for the soap

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:39.675
for the next few years,at least.

00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:40.815
you were right about everything.

00:00:40.845 --> 00:00:43.215
sam winchester is 
more than a monster.

00:00:43.245 --> 00:00:44.975
i'm not even sure he's human.

00:00:45.015 --> 00:00:46.815
we got to get me the hell out of here.

00:01:04.715 --> 00:01:06.515
it's rude to sneak up on people.

00:01:06.545 --> 00:01:08.175
bela talbot.

00:01:08.215 --> 00:01:10.745
you have me at a disadvantage.

00:01:10.775 --> 00:01:12.715
i don't know who you are.

00:01:12.745 --> 00:01:14.545
gordon walker.

00:01:16.815 --> 00:01:18.145
i've heard of you.

00:01:21.275 --> 00:01:23.075
heard you were in prison.

00:01:23.115 --> 00:01:24.415
got out.

00:01:24.445 --> 00:01:26.645
released early on good behavior?

00:01:30.775 --> 00:01:32.075
you looking for this?

00:01:40.775 --> 00:01:43.415
i know you were just 
in massachusetts,

00:01:43.445 --> 00:01:46.615
and i know you were with 
the winchester boys.

00:01:47.505 --> 00:01:49.145
tell me where they are.

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:51.845
i don't think i know.

00:01:51.875 --> 00:01:53.275
why don't you think a little harder?

00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:55.405
put that down.

00:01:56.845 --> 00:01:58.745
what's so pressing about 
finding the boys,anyway?

00:01:58.775 --> 00:02:00.815
sam winchester's the antichrist.

00:02:00.845 --> 00:02:04.115
i'd heard something 
about that... it's true.

00:02:04.145 --> 00:02:06.745
... from my good friend,
the easter bunny,

00:02:06.775 --> 00:02:08.845
who'd heard it from the tooth fairy.

00:02:08.875 --> 00:02:10.875
are you off your meds?

00:02:10.915 --> 00:02:12.945
the world hangs in the balance.

00:02:12.975 --> 00:02:15.305
so you go ahead and be 
a smart-ass,

00:02:15.345 --> 00:02:18.175
but tell me where they are,
or i shoot.

00:02:18.215 --> 00:02:21.245
gordon,you and i don't know
each other very well,

00:02:21.275 --> 00:02:24.145
so let me tell you a little
something about me.

00:02:24.175 --> 00:02:26.245
i don't respond well to threats,

00:02:26.275 --> 00:02:27.815
but you make me an offer,

00:02:27.845 --> 00:02:30.645
and i think you'll find
me highly cooperative.

00:02:30.675 --> 00:02:33.605
okay.

00:02:33.645 --> 00:02:34.845
how about...

00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:38.015
you tell me where they are,
or i kill you right now?

00:02:38.045 --> 00:02:39.405
kill me.

00:02:39.445 --> 00:02:41.115
good luck finding sam and dean.

00:02:48.245 --> 00:02:49.975
i can wrangle up three grand.

00:02:51.245 --> 00:02:53.345
i don't get out of bed for three grand.

00:02:53.375 --> 00:02:55.545
you...

00:02:57.775 --> 00:02:59.045
scratch that.

00:02:59.075 --> 00:03:01.675
give me the mojo bag,
and we'll call it even.

00:03:01.705 --> 00:03:03.175
oh,hell,no.

00:03:03.215 --> 00:03:05.245
this thing's a century old. it's...

00:03:05.275 --> 00:03:06.845
priceless.

00:03:06.875 --> 00:03:09.175
believe me,i know.

00:03:09.215 --> 00:03:13.675
now,how badly do you 
want the winchesters?

00:03:29.945 --> 00:03:32.375
hello,dean?

00:03:32.405 --> 00:03:34.475
hey,where are you?

00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:40.815
supernatural season 3 episode 7

00:03:59.815 --> 00:04:01.375
hey,hey. don't worry.

00:04:01.405 --> 00:04:03.075
we're gonna call you some help,okay?

00:04:03.115 --> 00:04:05.175
where is she? where'd she go?!

00:04:59.875 --> 00:05:02.215
smell that?!

00:05:02.245 --> 00:05:04.945
come and get it!

00:05:04.975 --> 00:05:07.045
that's right.

00:05:07.075 --> 00:05:08.545
come on.

00:05:08.575 --> 00:05:10.305
i smell good,don't i?

00:05:10.345 --> 00:05:11.815
i taste even better.

00:05:22.015 --> 00:05:23.845
come on!

00:05:23.875 --> 00:05:25.845
free lunch!

00:05:43.045 --> 00:05:44.575
what?

00:05:44.605 --> 00:05:47.495
cutting it a little close,
don't you think?

00:05:47.495 --> 00:05:50.795
ah,that's just chum in the water.

00:05:50.825 --> 00:05:52.795
worked,didn't it?

00:06:25.495 --> 00:06:26.695
you with us?

00:06:28.725 --> 00:06:30.925
oh,yeah,sorry.

00:06:30.965 --> 00:06:32.765
you're not going anywhere.

00:06:32.795 --> 00:06:34.865
where's your nest? what?

00:06:34.895 --> 00:06:37.865
nest... where you and your
bloodsucking pals hang out.

00:06:37.895 --> 00:06:39.295
i don't know what 
you're talking about.

00:06:39.325 --> 00:06:41.425
please!

00:06:41.465 --> 00:06:42.765
i don't feel good.

00:06:42.795 --> 00:06:45.465
yeah,well,you're gonna feel
a hell of a lot worse

00:06:45.495 --> 00:06:48.125
if we give you another shot
of dead man's blood.

00:06:48.165 --> 00:06:49.795
just let me go.

00:06:49.825 --> 00:06:52.265
yeah,you know we can't do that.

00:06:52.295 --> 00:06:54.065
i'm telling you the truth.

00:06:54.095 --> 00:06:56.125
i'm just... i took something.

00:06:56.165 --> 00:06:57.595
i'm freaking out!

00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:00.995
i don't know what's going on!

00:07:02.065 --> 00:07:03.825
you took something? yes!

00:07:06.765 --> 00:07:10.665
i can't...calm down.

00:07:10.695 --> 00:07:13.165
i just want to calm down.

00:07:13.195 --> 00:07:14.995
what's your name?

00:07:15.025 --> 00:07:17.095
lucy.

00:07:17.125 --> 00:07:19.225
please,just let me go.

00:07:19.265 --> 00:07:21.565
all right,lucy,how about this?

00:07:21.595 --> 00:07:23.625
if you tell us what happened,

00:07:23.665 --> 00:07:26.295
we'll let you go.

00:07:26.325 --> 00:07:27.525
you will?

00:07:30.925 --> 00:07:33.965
uh,i don't really...

00:07:33.995 --> 00:07:36.965
um,it's not that clear.

00:07:36.995 --> 00:07:39.195
i was at spider.

00:07:39.225 --> 00:07:40.865
spider?

00:07:40.895 --> 00:07:42.625
the club on jefferson.

00:07:42.665 --> 00:07:44.995
and there was this guy...
he was buying me drinks.

00:07:45.025 --> 00:07:47.425
this guy... what's he look like?

00:07:49.565 --> 00:07:51.365
he was old,like 30.

00:07:51.395 --> 00:07:55.465
he had brown hair,a leather jacket...

00:07:55.495 --> 00:07:58.495
deacon or dixon or something.

00:07:58.525 --> 00:08:02.225
said he was a dealer...
he had something for me.

00:08:04.195 --> 00:08:05.865
- something?
- something new.

00:08:05.895 --> 00:08:09.225
"better than anything you've ever tried."

00:08:11.725 --> 00:08:13.465
he put a few drops in my drink.

00:08:16.995 --> 00:08:18.965
was the drug red and thick?

00:08:21.395 --> 00:08:24.325
well,genius move there.

00:08:24.365 --> 00:08:26.495
that was vampire blood he dosed you with.

00:08:26.525 --> 00:08:27.795
what?

00:08:27.825 --> 00:08:30.195
you just took a big shot of
the nastiest virus out there.

00:08:30.225 --> 00:08:31.995
you're crazy!

00:08:32.025 --> 00:08:34.495
he gave me roofies or something!

00:08:34.525 --> 00:08:35.995
no...

00:08:36.025 --> 00:08:38.395
the next thing i know,we're at his place,

00:08:38.425 --> 00:08:40.365
and he says he's gonna get
me something to eat,

00:08:40.395 --> 00:08:42.065
just wait.

00:08:42.095 --> 00:08:46.025
but i get so hungry.

00:08:46.065 --> 00:08:48.365
so you busted out?

00:08:49.565 --> 00:08:52.895
but it won't wear off...

00:08:52.925 --> 00:08:55.595
whatever he gave me?

00:08:55.625 --> 00:08:57.865
lights are too bright?

00:08:57.895 --> 00:08:59.795
sunshine hurt your skin?

00:09:01.595 --> 00:09:03.695
yeah...

00:09:03.725 --> 00:09:06.025
and smells.

00:09:08.265 --> 00:09:12.925
and i can... hear blood pumping.

00:09:12.965 --> 00:09:14.595
i hate to tell you this,sweetheart,

00:09:14.625 --> 00:09:17.365
but your blood's never pumping again.

00:09:17.395 --> 00:09:19.465
not mine...

00:09:19.495 --> 00:09:22.365
yours.

00:09:22.395 --> 00:09:27.825
i can hear a heart beating from
half a block away.

00:09:29.725 --> 00:09:32.325
i just want it to stop.

00:09:37.025 --> 00:09:39.565
it's not going to stop.

00:09:39.595 --> 00:09:43.095
you've already killed two people...
almost three.

00:09:43.125 --> 00:09:45.465
no,i couldn't.

00:09:45.495 --> 00:09:47.725
- i was hallucinating!
- you killed them,all right?

00:09:47.765 --> 00:09:50.565
we've been following a sloppy
trail of corpses,

00:09:50.595 --> 00:09:52.265
and it leads straight to you.

00:09:52.295 --> 00:09:54.925
no. no,it wasn't real!

00:09:54.965 --> 00:09:57.125
it was the drug!

00:09:57.165 --> 00:09:59.995
please!

00:10:01.865 --> 00:10:04.525
please,you have to help me!

00:10:07.325 --> 00:10:10.325
no,no.

00:10:17.165 --> 00:10:18.795
poor girl.

00:10:18.825 --> 00:10:20.565
we don't have a choice.

00:10:31.965 --> 00:10:35.025
no...please!

00:10:53.225 --> 00:10:56.125
sir,a few questions about the attack.

00:10:56.165 --> 00:10:58.495
i already talked to the cops.

00:10:58.525 --> 00:11:00.125
well,we're not cops. we're fbi.

00:11:00.165 --> 00:11:01.465
fbi?

00:11:01.495 --> 00:11:03.965
can you describe your attacker?

00:11:06.265 --> 00:11:07.725
she was crazy.

00:11:07.765 --> 00:11:10.565
she had that,uh,super-pcp strength,you know?

00:11:10.595 --> 00:11:13.025
she gnawed on my neck.

00:11:13.065 --> 00:11:14.225
and did she bleed on you?

00:11:14.265 --> 00:11:15.665
on me,no.

00:11:15.695 --> 00:11:17.865
in your mouth,open wound,anything?

00:11:17.895 --> 00:11:20.295
- you sure about that?
- yeah,i'm sure. why?

00:11:20.325 --> 00:11:22.165
this woman has a very dangerous virus.

00:11:22.195 --> 00:11:24.965
what? she bit me in the neck.

00:11:24.995 --> 00:11:26.195
the bite doesn't matter.

00:11:26.225 --> 00:11:29.125
you have to actually ingest
the blood to be infected.

00:11:29.165 --> 00:11:31.765
good thing,too. we'd have had to kill you.

00:11:39.295 --> 00:11:40.365
the attack?

00:11:40.395 --> 00:11:42.295
she jumped me,then bit me.

00:11:42.325 --> 00:11:45.025
then those two guys found me
and chased her down the alley.

00:11:45.065 --> 00:11:47.495
- what did they look like?
- i didn't get a good look.

00:11:47.525 --> 00:11:48.695
think.

00:11:48.725 --> 00:11:52.125
one of them was real tall.

00:11:57.925 --> 00:11:59.725
that was a big,fat waste of time.

00:11:59.765 --> 00:12:03.795
look,three blondes have gone
missing,including lucy...

00:12:03.825 --> 00:12:05.965
all last sighted here.

00:12:05.995 --> 00:12:08.695
i'm telling you,dean,this is the hunting ground.

00:12:16.795 --> 00:12:20.165
you're sick.

00:12:20.195 --> 00:12:22.995
you ready,sweetie?

00:12:23.025 --> 00:12:25.525
one taste of this,you'll never be the same.

00:12:29.195 --> 00:12:31.825
get out of here. go! go!

00:12:35.265 --> 00:12:36.765
dean!

00:12:36.795 --> 00:12:39.325
i'm good. come on.

00:13:02.315 --> 00:13:04.615
all right. run. i'll draw them off.

00:13:04.655 --> 00:13:06.385
what?! you're crazy!

00:14:06.155 --> 00:14:08.285
there you are!

00:14:08.315 --> 00:14:09.615
yeah.

00:14:09.655 --> 00:14:11.615
sorry,i stopped for a slice.

00:14:11.655 --> 00:14:13.585
nice move you pulled back there,dean...

00:14:13.615 --> 00:14:15.155
running right at the weapons.

00:14:15.185 --> 00:14:18.815
well,what can i say? i'm a bad-ass.

00:14:18.855 --> 00:14:21.085
so,i guess gordon's out of jail.

00:14:21.115 --> 00:14:22.685
uh,yeah,i guess so.

00:14:22.715 --> 00:14:26.215
how the hell did he know where to find us?

00:14:26.255 --> 00:14:28.085
that bitch.

00:14:32.185 --> 00:14:34.015
- hi,bela.
- hello,dean.

00:14:34.055 --> 00:14:35.355
question for you.

00:14:35.385 --> 00:14:36.885
when you called me yesterday,

00:14:36.915 --> 00:14:39.955
it wasn't to thank me for
saving your ass,was it?

00:14:39.985 --> 00:14:41.855
gordon walker paid me to tell
him where you were.

00:14:41.885 --> 00:14:43.285
excuse me?

00:14:43.315 --> 00:14:45.915
well,he had a gun on me.
what else was i supposed to do?

00:14:45.955 --> 00:14:47.855
i don't know,maybe pick up the phone

00:14:47.885 --> 00:14:49.885
and tell us that a raging
psychopath was dropping by!

00:14:49.915 --> 00:14:51.715
i did fully intend to call.

00:14:51.755 --> 00:14:53.685
- i just got a bit sidetracked.
- he tried to kill us!

00:14:53.715 --> 00:14:56.755
i'm sorry. i didn't realize
it was such big deal.

00:14:56.785 --> 00:14:59.685
after all,there are two
of you and one of him.

00:14:59.715 --> 00:15:01.155
there were two of them.

00:15:02.515 --> 00:15:05.155
bela,if we make it out of this alive,

00:15:05.185 --> 00:15:06.815
the first thing i'm gonna do is kill you.

00:15:06.855 --> 00:15:09.485
you're not serious.

00:15:09.515 --> 00:15:12.155
listen to my voice and tell me
if i'm serious.

00:15:52.785 --> 00:15:55.855
i know you're uncomfortable...

00:15:55.885 --> 00:15:58.485
but this is just temporary.

00:15:58.515 --> 00:16:01.555
the hunger will pass,and then
you'll feel much better.

00:16:05.785 --> 00:16:08.715
- you're awake.
- who are they?

00:16:08.755 --> 00:16:09.885
family.

00:16:09.915 --> 00:16:11.755
you always keep your family in shackles?

00:16:11.785 --> 00:16:14.755
we're still getting to know each other.

00:16:14.785 --> 00:16:16.615
they've just been reborn.

00:16:16.655 --> 00:16:18.685
you mean you grabbed some
poor girls off the street

00:16:18.715 --> 00:16:19.985
and made them monsters like you.

00:16:20.015 --> 00:16:22.285
i do what i have to.

00:16:22.315 --> 00:16:25.315
we're a dying breed.

00:16:25.355 --> 00:16:29.555
but,then,you know that,
don't you,gordon?

00:16:29.585 --> 00:16:33.415
gordon walker...

00:16:33.455 --> 00:16:36.655
one of the greatest 
living vampire hunters.

00:16:36.685 --> 00:16:39.355
in the flesh.

00:16:39.385 --> 00:16:42.255
you're a big part of why my
people are nearly extinct.

00:16:44.515 --> 00:16:47.255
your "people" are going extinct

00:16:47.285 --> 00:16:50.285
because you're a bunch of mindless,
bloodthirsty animals.

00:16:53.815 --> 00:16:55.185
right.

00:16:55.215 --> 00:16:58.485
we're so much more bloodthirsty than you.

00:16:58.515 --> 00:17:01.355
hunters slaughtered my entire nest

00:17:01.385 --> 00:17:03.455
like they were having a party...

00:17:03.485 --> 00:17:06.585
murdered my daughter.

00:17:06.615 --> 00:17:09.955
i can't tell you how satisfying this is...

00:17:09.985 --> 00:17:12.955
catching a hunter
responsible for so many deaths

00:17:12.985 --> 00:17:17.384
and making you lunch for my new daughters.

00:17:17.414 --> 00:17:19.455
"daughters?"

00:17:22.414 --> 00:17:24.414
try "fang whores."

00:17:25.755 --> 00:17:27.715
watch your mouth.

00:17:27.755 --> 00:17:31.115
oh,did i hurt your feelings? i'm sorry.

00:17:31.154 --> 00:17:34.414
i forgot you're just a 
misunderstood victim...

00:17:34.455 --> 00:17:37.485
even though you murder and
spread your filthy disease

00:17:37.515 --> 00:17:40.384
on pure base instinct.

00:17:40.414 --> 00:17:42.315
you got less humanity 
than a sewer rat.

00:17:42.355 --> 00:17:45.315
i'm sorry you have such
a low opinion of my people.

00:17:45.355 --> 00:17:48.285
oh,you have no idea.

00:17:51.985 --> 00:17:55.215
sorry,change of plans.

00:17:55.255 --> 00:17:58.255
i'll be going out to get your lunch.

00:17:58.285 --> 00:18:00.485
i've got a better idea for you.

00:18:10.414 --> 00:18:12.355
no!

00:18:16.654 --> 00:18:18.115
no!

00:18:18.154 --> 00:18:19.815
no!!

00:18:24.715 --> 00:18:27.455
that vampire's still out there,dean.

00:18:27.485 --> 00:18:29.615
first things first.

00:18:29.654 --> 00:18:30.955
gordon.

00:18:30.985 --> 00:18:34.615
about that... when we find him,
or if he finds us...

00:18:34.654 --> 00:18:36.585
i'm just saying he's not leaving
us a whole lot of options.

00:18:36.615 --> 00:18:38.555
yeah,i know. we've got to kill him.

00:18:38.585 --> 00:18:41.055
really?

00:18:41.085 --> 00:18:43.115
just like that?

00:18:43.154 --> 00:18:45.315
i thought you would have been like,

00:18:45.355 --> 00:18:47.815
"no,we can't. he's human. it's wrong."

00:18:47.855 --> 00:18:49.555
no,i'm done.

00:18:49.585 --> 00:18:52.215
gordon's not gonna 
stop until we're dead...

00:18:53.585 --> 00:18:55.384
... or till he is.

00:18:59.085 --> 00:19:01.154
what?!

00:19:01.184 --> 00:19:03.255
i don't like it when people
hold grudges against me,

00:19:03.285 --> 00:19:05.414
and more to the point,
i'd rather you didn't kill me,

00:19:05.455 --> 00:19:07.755
so i went ahead and found gordon's
exact location for you.

00:19:07.785 --> 00:19:09.884
you're a hundred miles away.
how the hell did you...

00:19:09.914 --> 00:19:11.985
hello? 
purveyor of powerful occult objects?

00:19:12.015 --> 00:19:14.315
i used a talking board to
contact the other side.

00:19:14.355 --> 00:19:15.815
- and?
- warehouse.

00:19:15.855 --> 00:19:18.755
two stories,riverfront,
neon sign outside.

00:19:18.785 --> 00:19:19.955
thanks. one more thing...

00:19:19.985 --> 00:19:21.355
the spirit had a message for you.

00:19:21.384 --> 00:19:23.755
"leave town,run like hell,
and whatever you do,

00:19:23.785 --> 00:19:25.585
don't go after gordon."

00:19:25.615 --> 00:19:28.585
for whatever that's worth

00:20:26.914 --> 00:20:30.215
please  help us

00:20:30.255 --> 00:20:31.485
please

00:22:36.525 --> 00:22:38.884
go ahead

00:22:38.924 --> 00:22:41.625
do it

00:22:41.654 --> 00:22:42.955
kill me

00:22:42.985 --> 00:22:45.654
what happened here?

00:22:45.684 --> 00:22:48.684
gordon walker

00:22:50.625 --> 00:22:53.654
i never should have brought a hunter here

00:22:53.684 --> 00:22:54.855
never

00:22:54.884 --> 00:22:56.355
i just

00:22:56.384 --> 00:22:59.355
i just wanted some kind of revenge

00:22:59.384 --> 00:23:03.485
stupid... exposing him to my family

00:23:03.525 --> 00:23:05.154
oh,yeah,you're such a family man

00:23:09.755 --> 00:23:11.955
you don't understand

00:23:11.985 --> 00:23:14.055
i don't want to understand,you son

00:23:14.085 --> 00:23:17.625
i was desperate you ever felt desperate?

00:23:19.384 --> 00:23:22.154
i've lost everyone i ever loved

00:23:22.184 --> 00:23:24.085
i'm staring down eternity alone

00:23:26.085 --> 00:23:28.485
can you think of a worse hell?

00:23:29.684 --> 00:23:31.485
well,there's hell

00:23:34.055 --> 00:23:36.225
i wasn't thinking

00:23:36.255 --> 00:23:39.225
i just

00:23:39.255 --> 00:23:42.325
i didn't care anymore

00:23:42.355 --> 00:23:44.055
do you know it's like

00:23:44.085 --> 00:23:47.924
when you just don't give a damn?

00:23:47.955 --> 00:23:50.255
it's like

00:23:50.285 --> 00:23:52.455
it's like being dead already

00:23:53.755 --> 00:23:56.325
so just go ahead

00:23:57.525 --> 00:23:58.485
do it

00:24:00.585 --> 00:24:02.325
dean

00:24:05.325 --> 00:24:07.985
head wasn't cut off,it was ripped off

00:24:09.424 --> 00:24:12.025
with someone's bare hands

00:24:12.055 --> 00:24:15.654
Dixon,what did you do to gordon?

00:24:42.455 --> 00:24:44.684
Gordon

00:24:46.985 --> 00:24:49.424
you okay?

00:24:49.455 --> 00:24:52.225
not even close

00:24:52.255 --> 00:24:53.955
i thought maybe you were dead

00:24:56.955 --> 00:24:58.424
what is it?

00:25:01.424 --> 00:25:04.384
something happened

00:25:04.424 --> 00:25:06.755
what?

00:25:09.785 --> 00:25:12.025
they turned me

00:25:12.055 --> 00:25:13.384
those fangs?

00:25:19.154 --> 00:25:21.555
I'm sorry

00:25:23.125 --> 00:25:25.285
you know what this means

00:25:28.485 --> 00:25:30.125
It means you have to kill me

00:25:35.485 --> 00:25:37.085
but not yet

00:25:37.125 --> 00:25:38.625
what do you mean?

00:25:38.654 --> 00:25:41.255
you have to let me do 
one last thing first

00:25:41.285 --> 00:25:43.154
what?

00:25:43.184 --> 00:25:45.485
- kill sam winchester
- gordon

00:25:45.525 --> 00:25:46.985
it's the only...

00:25:47.025 --> 00:25:50.225
it is the one good thing
to come out of this nightmare

00:25:55.985 --> 00:25:59.125
gordon i'm sorry

00:26:00.355 --> 00:26:03.025
you know i can't let 
you walk out of here

00:26:03.055 --> 00:26:04.684
listen to me

00:26:04.725 --> 00:26:08.825
there is nothing more important

00:26:08.855 --> 00:26:10.485
please

00:26:21.525 --> 00:26:24.625
i can do one last good 
thing for the world

00:26:27.355 --> 00:26:30.755
yeah i hear you

00:26:34.355 --> 00:26:37.154
you know gordon

00:26:37.184 --> 00:26:39.255
you're right

00:26:39.285 --> 00:26:42.884
one last good thing

00:27:01.184 --> 00:27:03.654
i'm sorry

00:27:17.924 --> 00:27:20.384
man,i must have checked three dozen motels,

00:27:20.424 --> 00:27:22.154
empty buildings,warehouses

00:27:22.184 --> 00:27:24.855
yeah,me too

00:27:24.884 --> 00:27:26.384
big city

00:27:26.424 --> 00:27:30.125
it's like a giant haystack
and gordon's a deadly needle

00:27:31.985 --> 00:27:33.255
we're running out of daylight

00:27:33.285 --> 00:27:34.884
won't have the sun slowing him down

00:27:34.924 --> 00:27:38.055
yeah,he'll be unstoppable

00:27:38.085 --> 00:27:40.225
hey,give me your phone

00:27:40.255 --> 00:27:41.884
what for?

00:27:41.924 --> 00:27:44.184
well,if gordon knows 
our cell numbers

00:27:44.225 --> 00:27:47.355
he can use the cell 
signal to track us down

00:27:47.384 --> 00:27:49.355
oh,yeah thanks

00:27:56.785 --> 00:27:59.455
sammy,stay here

00:27:59.485 --> 00:28:03.125
what? where you going now?

00:28:03.154 --> 00:28:04.785
i'm going after gordon

00:28:04.825 --> 00:28:06.184
what?

00:28:06.225 --> 00:28:07.525
you heard me

00:28:07.555 --> 00:28:08.955
not alone,you're not

00:28:08.985 --> 00:28:12.055
sam,i don't need you to sign
me a permission slip,okay?

00:28:12.085 --> 00:28:14.654
he's after you,not me,
and he's turbocharged

00:28:14.684 --> 00:28:16.785
i want you to stay out of harm's way

00:28:16.825 --> 00:28:18.025
i'll take care of it

00:28:18.055 --> 00:28:20.085
you're not going by yourself
you're gonna get killed

00:28:20.125 --> 00:28:21.785
just another day at the office

00:28:21.825 --> 00:28:24.085
it's a massively dangerous
day at the office

00:28:24.125 --> 00:28:26.585
so you're the guy with nothing
to lose now,huh?

00:28:26.625 --> 00:28:28.455
oh,wait let me guess because,uh

00:28:28.485 --> 00:28:29.884
it's because you're 
already dead,right?

00:28:29.924 --> 00:28:32.424
- if the shoe fits
- you know what,man?

00:28:32.455 --> 00:28:33.955
i'm sick and tired of 
your kamikaze trip

00:28:33.985 --> 00:28:36.085
whoa,whoa kamikaze?

00:28:36.125 --> 00:28:37.985
i'm more like a ninja

00:28:38.025 --> 00:28:39.555
- that's not funny
- it's a little funny

00:28:39.585 --> 00:28:40.555
no,it's not

00:28:43.325 --> 00:28:45.154
what do you want me to do,sam,huh...

00:28:45.184 --> 00:28:48.585
sit around all day writing sad
poems about how i'm gonna die?

00:28:48.625 --> 00:28:50.255
you know what? i got one

00:28:50.285 --> 00:28:53.184
let's see what rhymes with "shut up,sam"?

00:28:53.225 --> 00:28:55.384
dude drop the attitude,dean

00:28:55.424 --> 00:28:57.184
quit turning everything into a punch line

00:28:57.225 --> 00:28:58.455
and you know something else?

00:28:58.485 --> 00:29:00.255
stop trying to act like you're not afraid

00:29:00.285 --> 00:29:01.924
- I'm not!
- You're lying

00:29:01.955 --> 00:29:04.485
you may as well drop it 'cause
i can see right through you

00:29:04.525 --> 00:29:07.955
you got no idea what 
you're talking about

00:29:07.985 --> 00:29:10.855
yeah,i do you're scared,dean

00:29:10.884 --> 00:29:13.154
you're scared because your
year is running out

00:29:13.184 --> 00:29:15.255
and you're still going
to hell and you're freaked

00:29:15.285 --> 00:29:17.184
- and how do you know that?
- because i know you!

00:29:17.225 --> 00:29:18.384
really?

00:29:18.424 --> 00:29:21.785
yeah,i've been following
you around my entire life!

00:29:21.825 --> 00:29:25.424
i mean,i've been looking up
to you since i was four,dean...

00:29:25.455 --> 00:29:28.585
studying you,trying to be
just like my big brother

00:29:28.625 --> 00:29:30.055
so,yeah,i know you...

00:29:30.085 --> 00:29:32.785
better than anyone else
in the entire world

00:29:32.825 --> 00:29:35.184
and this

00:29:35.225 --> 00:29:38.424
is exactly how you act
when you're terrified

00:29:41.924 --> 00:29:44.725
and,i mean,i can't blame you

00:29:44.755 --> 00:29:46.755
it's just

00:29:50.255 --> 00:29:51.585
what?

00:29:54.184 --> 00:29:58.184
i wish you would drop the
show and be my brother again

00:29:58.225 --> 00:30:00.055
cause

00:30:02.384 --> 00:30:05.085
just 'cause

00:30:12.585 --> 00:30:14.485
all right,we'll hole up

00:30:14.525 --> 00:30:16.485
cover our scent so he can't track us,

00:30:16.525 --> 00:30:19.654
and wait the night out here

00:30:50.255 --> 00:30:52.585
you've had that phone two hours,dean

00:30:52.625 --> 00:30:54.085
who'd you give the number to?

00:30:54.125 --> 00:30:55.785
nobody

00:30:59.955 --> 00:31:01.684
- hello?
- dean

00:31:04.555 --> 00:31:05.855
how'd you get this number?

00:31:05.884 --> 00:31:08.085
your scent's all over the cellphone store

00:31:08.125 --> 00:31:09.924
of course,i can't smell you now

00:31:09.955 --> 00:31:12.725
- where are you?
- I guess you'll just have to find us

00:31:12.755 --> 00:31:16.025
i'd rather you come to me
what's the matter,gordo?

00:31:16.055 --> 00:31:17.884
you're not afraid of us,are you?

00:31:17.924 --> 00:31:19.955
we're just sitting here bring it on!

00:31:19.985 --> 00:31:23.625
i don't think so

00:31:23.654 --> 00:31:24.955
please

00:31:24.985 --> 00:31:26.625
please

00:31:26.654 --> 00:31:28.654
shh

00:31:31.625 --> 00:31:33.955
factory on riverside off the turnpike.

00:31:33.985 --> 00:31:36.085
be here in 20 minutes

00:31:36.125 --> 00:31:37.725
or the girl dies.

00:31:37.755 --> 00:31:39.055
- gordon,let the girl go.
- bye,dean.

00:31:39.085 --> 00:31:41.154
gordon! don't do this.

00:31:41.184 --> 00:31:43.384
you don't kill innocent people.

00:31:43.424 --> 00:31:44.825
you're still a hunter.

00:31:44.855 --> 00:31:48.285
no...

00:31:48.325 --> 00:31:50.785
i'm a monster.

00:32:08.715 --> 00:32:10.515
hey,we got you.

00:32:10.545 --> 00:32:13.045
don't worry. we're gonna
get you out of here.

00:32:17.015 --> 00:32:19.815
get up. watch your head.
watch your head.

00:32:22.945 --> 00:32:24.445
sam,stay close.

00:32:29.674 --> 00:32:32.115
- sam!
- dean!

00:32:33.015 --> 00:32:35.644
damn it,sam!

00:32:57.914 --> 00:33:00.815
gordon...

00:33:00.845 --> 00:33:03.485
you got me where you want me.

00:33:03.515 --> 00:33:05.384
you might as well come out and fight!

00:33:05.414 --> 00:33:06.715
i'm right here,sam.

00:33:12.575 --> 00:33:14.245
what's the matter,sammy?

00:33:14.285 --> 00:33:16.715
so,this is really the way
you want to do it,huh?

00:33:16.745 --> 00:33:20.015
damn right i do.

00:33:29.085 --> 00:33:32.085
you have no idea what i faced...

00:33:32.115 --> 00:33:35.285
to get here.

00:33:35.315 --> 00:33:38.414
i lost everything...

00:33:38.445 --> 00:33:39.845
my life.

00:33:41.644 --> 00:33:45.884
but it's worth it cause
i'm finally gonna kill

00:33:45.914 --> 00:33:49.384
the most dangerous thing i ever hunted.

00:33:49.414 --> 00:33:51.414
you're not human,sam.

00:33:51.445 --> 00:33:54.215
look who's talking.

00:33:56.285 --> 00:33:58.674
you're right.

00:33:58.715 --> 00:34:00.745
i'm a bloodthirsty killer.

00:34:00.785 --> 00:34:03.315
- don't talk about it like you don't have a choice.
- i don't.

00:34:03.345 --> 00:34:05.115
yes,you do,gordon.

00:34:05.144 --> 00:34:06.445
you didn't kill that girl.

00:34:06.485 --> 00:34:08.715
no,i didn't.

00:34:10.245 --> 00:34:13.545
i did something much,much worse.

00:34:37.715 --> 00:34:40.345
i got to hand it to you,sam.

00:34:40.385 --> 00:34:42.985
you got a lot of people fooled,

00:34:43.014 --> 00:34:45.385
but,see,i know the truth.

00:34:45.414 --> 00:34:49.315
i know what it's like.

00:34:49.345 --> 00:34:52.945
we're the same now,you and me.

00:34:52.985 --> 00:34:56.315
i know how it is

00:34:56.345 --> 00:34:59.315
walking around with something
evil inside you.

00:34:59.644 --> 00:35:02.385
it's just too bad you won't
do the right thing

00:35:02.414 --> 00:35:04.085
and kill yourself.

00:35:04.115 --> 00:35:06.184
i'm gonna...

00:35:06.215 --> 00:35:07.545
as soon as i'm done with you.

00:35:07.575 --> 00:35:09.815
two last good deeds...

00:35:09.845 --> 00:35:13.014
killing you...

00:35:13.045 --> 00:35:14.945
and killing myself.

00:35:36.914 --> 00:35:37.985
no!

00:36:58.715 --> 00:37:04.644
you just charged a super-vamped-out
gordon with no weapon.

00:37:04.675 --> 00:37:07.514
that's a little reckless,don't you think?

00:37:18.414 --> 00:37:20.345
- there you go.
- thanks.

00:37:20.375 --> 00:37:22.675
figure out what's making that rattle?

00:37:22.715 --> 00:37:25.815
not yet.

00:37:25.845 --> 00:37:27.775
give me a box wrench,would you?

00:37:27.815 --> 00:37:28.974
yeah.

00:37:29.014 --> 00:37:31.474
- there you go.
- thanks.

00:37:38.875 --> 00:37:40.545
sam.

00:37:40.575 --> 00:37:42.575
- wrong one?
- no,come here for a second.

00:37:46.315 --> 00:37:47.945
yeah.

00:37:51.184 --> 00:37:53.815
this rattle could be a couple of things.

00:37:53.845 --> 00:37:56.345
i'm thinking it's an out-of-tune car.

00:37:56.375 --> 00:37:59.845
okay.

00:37:59.875 --> 00:38:01.514
all right,see this thing?

00:38:01.545 --> 00:38:03.014
it's a valve cover.

00:38:03.045 --> 00:38:05.414
inside are all the parts that are on the head.

00:38:05.445 --> 00:38:07.345
hand me that socket wrench.

00:38:07.375 --> 00:38:10.014
all right,you with me so far?

00:38:10.045 --> 00:38:12.675
yeah,uh,valve cover covers the heads.

00:38:12.715 --> 00:38:14.014
very good.

00:38:14.045 --> 00:38:17.115
this is your intake manifold,
and on top of it?

00:38:17.144 --> 00:38:20.474
it's,uh,a carburetor.

00:38:20.514 --> 00:38:24.275
carburetor... very good.

00:38:24.315 --> 00:38:26.144
what's with the auto shop?

00:38:29.414 --> 00:38:30.875
you don't mean you want...

00:38:30.914 --> 00:38:32.775
yeah,i do.

00:38:32.815 --> 00:38:34.275
you fix it.

00:38:34.315 --> 00:38:36.275
dean,you barely let me drive this thing.

00:38:36.315 --> 00:38:39.445
well,it's time. you should
know how to fix it.

00:38:39.474 --> 00:38:42.144
you're gonna need to know these
things for the future.

00:38:50.144 --> 00:38:53.345
and,besides,that's my job,right?

00:38:53.375 --> 00:38:56.615
show my little brother the ropes.

00:39:17.545 --> 00:39:20.275
put your shoulder into it.



